  "body_text": "黄柠檬，花香，蜂蜜甜，绿茶感\nLemon, Floral, Honeyed sweet, Green-tea like\n基本信息\n国家：\n埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n产区：\n南部部族州-盖迪奥-耶加雪菲 Yirgacheffe, Gedeo, SNNPR\n庄园/处理厂：阿瑞查 Aricha Washing Station\n品种：\n原生种 Heirloom\n海拔：1950\n- 2150 米\n处理方式：水洗 Washed\n烘焙度：\n浅度 Light Roasted\n风味(日晒）：黄柠檬，花香\n，蜂蜜甜，绿茶感\nLemon，Floral，Honeyed Sweet，Green tea-like\n冲煮参数：\n中细的研磨度，粉水比1:14-1:15 （18g/270g），水温92-93，3次注水（40/130/100），总冲煮时间2分-2分半\n图片来自Counter Culture Coffee\n关于 Aricha\nAricha位于耶加雪菲镇中部，服务周边近900户小农；Aricha可能是我们国内咖啡圈从一开始接触到埃塞，接触到耶加雪菲开始就听到的名字，如今，它已成为耶加雪菲的一个咖啡中心，在其周围有我们耳熟能详的Idido, Gersi, Reko等处理站.\n更多豆豆选购，可进入小程序哦",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 14px;\">\n          黄柠檬，花香，蜂蜜甜，绿茶感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Lemon, Floral, Honeyed sweet, Green-tea like\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TGibSicpwKmrWuiaTuEoIDZfHth23Fcl50OOV4eBr8cWxyU9Ckj9GeWKSnxxkoIyJCRST3tmjXjMZCQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          基本信息\n         </strong>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          国家：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          产区：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          南部部族州-盖迪奥-耶加雪菲 Yirgacheffe, Gedeo, SNNPR\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园/处理厂：阿瑞查 Aricha Washing Station\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          原生种 Heirloom\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔：1950\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          - 2150 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味(日晒）：黄柠檬，花香\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，蜂蜜甜，绿茶感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Lemon，Floral，Honeyed Sweet，Green tea-like\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          冲煮参数：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          中细的研磨度，粉水比1:14-1:15 （18g/270g），水温92-93，3次注水（40/130/100），总冲煮时间2分-2分半\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TF779ZibCAGiacQwG0iaIWeNsKGDLicEgs99X1JiaH2XibUpsbCuPG3RqtA65qXKTuicpvfYHmbdRFw3YicA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来自Counter Culture Coffee\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n            关于 Aricha\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Aricha位于耶加雪菲镇中部，服务周边近900户小农；Aricha可能是我们国内咖啡圈从一开始接触到埃塞，接触到耶加雪菲开始就听到的名字，如今，它已成为耶加雪菲的一个咖啡中心，在其周围有我们耳熟能详的Idido, Gersi, Reko等处理站.\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TGibSicpwKmrWuiaTuEoIDZfHumMO6kNYmSRVBxL0xeH76m4er524B2CPuMVgtdPiagdwQUBHkZRRGAA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多豆豆选购，可进入小程序哦\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
